  "description": "If you want to experience untamed power on the trails – follow the HYBE! With our HYBE CF 11, we’re sending an absolute powerhouse into the race. An eMTB for riders who refuse to compromise on material and performance. The lightweight carbon frame saves weight on gruelling climbs, while the Bosch Performance CX-R motor paired with the powerful 800Wh battery unlocks that extra boost uphill. A premium RockShox suspension with 170mm of travel up front and 160mm at the rear easily absorbs jumps and drops. The responsive Sram DB Maven Ultimate disc brakes bring you to a quick and safe stop. And high-end Sram GX AXS components and the mullet wheel setup ensure perfect gearing and excellent traction on both the ups and downs. With this high-end race eFully, you’ll always be at the front of the pack. Just follow the HYBE!",
